  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Plotting the area of the smaller region enclosed by the curves <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2d0c096b-5eca-473b-932e-c5e45958a2ad-image.png\" style=\"width: 413px; height: 280px;\" /></p><p>Now finding point of intersection of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Both are symmetric about&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis</p><p>So, area will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><msqrt><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>",
